example:
确认和释放都要求当前是已预留。入库不改预留行：

```java
@Transactional
public boolean confirm(String orderId) {
  Reservation row = reservations.get(orderId);
  int updated = reservations.mark(orderId, "RESERVED", "DEDUCTED");
  if (updated != 1) return false;
  stock.moveReservedToDeducted(row.skuId(), row.qty());
  return true;
}

@Transactional
public boolean release(String orderId) {
  Reservation row = reservations.get(orderId);
  int updated = reservations.mark(orderId, "RESERVED", "RELEASED");
  if (updated != 1) return false;
  stock.moveReservedToAvailable(row.skuId(), row.qty());
  return true;
}

@Transactional
public boolean restock(String returnId, String skuId, int qty) {
  if (inbounds.seen(returnId)) return true;
  stock.addAvailable(skuId, qty);
  inbounds.insert(returnId, skuId, qty);
  return true;
}
```

```sql
UPDATE reservation SET status = 'DEDUCTED'
 WHERE order_id = ? AND status = 'RESERVED';
UPDATE reservation SET status = 'RELEASED'
 WHERE order_id = ? AND status = 'RESERVED';
```

两条里先成功的把 `RESERVED` 改掉。后一条影响 0 行，数量方法不会被调用。`restock` 只增加可售。
